              "type": "text",
              "html": "Pay by e-transfer to TJallen@thetorontosaunaco.com, bank draft, or cheque payable to The Toronto Sauna Co. Inc. No payment is due until your order is confirmed.",
              "text": "Pay by e-transfer to TJallen@thetorontosaunaco.com, bank draft, or cheque payable to The Toronto Sauna Co. Inc. No payment is due until your order is confirmed."
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "html": "This proposal is an estimate based on the options you selected and is valid until {{propValid}}. Items marked “on request” and delivery outside Ontario will be confirmed by our team before you order.",
              "text": "This proposal is an estimate based on the options you selected and is valid until {{propValid}}. Items marked “on request” and delivery outside Ontario will be confirmed by our team before you order."
