            {
              "type": "text",
              "html": "<strong>TERMS &amp; CONDITIONS</strong>",
              "text": "TERMS & CONDITIONS"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "html": "The Toronto Sauna Co. Inc.",
              "text": "The Toronto Sauna Co. Inc."
            },
            {
              "type": "list",
              "ordered": true,
              "items": [
                {
                  "html": "<strong>Deposit &amp; payment.</strong> A minimum $5,000.00 deposit (or the full amount on orders under $5,000.00) is required to confirm the order. The full balance is due 7 days before installation. If it is not received, installation may be rescheduled.",
                  "text": "Deposit & payment. A minimum $5,000.00 deposit (or the full amount on orders under $5,000.00) is required to confirm the order. The full balance is due 7 days before installation. If it is not received, installation may be rescheduled."
                },
                {
                  "html": "<strong>Cancellation.</strong> Once manufacturing begins, the deposit is non-refundable. Before that, cancellation must be in writing and may carry an administrative fee.",
                  "text": "Cancellation. Once manufacturing begins, the deposit is non-refundable. Before that, cancellation must be in writing and may carry an administrative fee."
                },
                {
                  "html": "<strong>Site readiness.</strong> The customer provides a level base, clear access for delivery, and a working electrical panel with capacity for the heater. A return visit caused by an unready site may be charged.",
                  "text": "Site readiness. The customer provides a level base, clear access for delivery, and a working electrical panel with capacity for the heater. A return visit caused by an unready site may be charged."
                },
                {
                  "html": "<strong>Electrical.</strong> All electrical heaters require a certified electrician. Wiring and inspection are the customer’s responsibility and are not included.",
                  "text": "Electrical. All electrical heaters require a certified electrician. Wiring and inspection are the customer’s responsibility and are not included."
                },
                {
                  "html": "<strong>Plumbing.</strong> All plumbing connections must be done by a plumber and are not included in the installation cost.",
                  "text": "Plumbing. All plumbing connections must be done by a plumber and are not included in the installation cost."
                },
                {
                  "html": "<strong>Schedule.</strong> Delivery and installation dates are estimates. We are not liable for delays outside our control, including supplier, carrier or weather delays.",
                  "text": "Schedule. Delivery and installation dates are estimates. We are not liable for delays outside our control, including supplier, carrier or weather delays."
                },
                {
                  "html": "<strong>Warranty.</strong> The sauna kit carries a five-year manufacturer warranty. Other products carry their manufacturer’s warranty. Warranty does not cover misuse, excess moisture, work by others, lack of maintenance, or natural wood variation.",
                  "text": "Warranty. The sauna kit carries a five-year manufacturer warranty. Other products carry their manufacturer’s warranty. Warranty does not cover misuse, excess moisture, work by others, lack of maintenance, or natural wood variation."
                }
